      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This feature is important because it lets you tell people apart at a glance. Right now, if Visitor and New User icons still appear at a distance, you can't distinguish them from Known, Trusted, or Friends. The whole point of the trust rank icon settings is to make those differences visible, so the settings should work consistently at every distance.",
